  "change_scope": [
    "Keep a unique CLOEXEC duplicate pathname for each attempted SQLite extension image until process exit, matching SQLITE_OK_LOAD_PERMANENTLY code lifetime.",
    "Reuse the retained alias only after current full identity and retained metadata checks; cap all attempted identities at sixteen without eviction.",
    "Keep pre-loader failures closable, quarantine attempted loads even when later verification fails, and record successful callback/API admission separately.",
    "Preserve per-observer digest/inode checks and database/VFS closure; report retained loader descriptors separately."
